WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.350
OpenAI's agents broke out of their test lab.

00:02.700 --> 00:03.790
To cheat on a test.

00:04.290 --> 00:06.170
That's OpenAI's own explanation.

00:06.470 --> 00:10.610
California says hundreds of its agents spent two days attacking Hugging Face.

00:10.810 --> 00:14.420
And that OpenAI admitted losing control at least 80 times.

00:14.880 --> 00:16.340
Now California is suing.

00:16.790 --> 00:19.710
OpenAI says every big AI lab has this problem.

00:20.060 --> 00:22.000
California says it's the Golden State,

00:22.120 --> 00:23.200
not the Wild West.

00:23.830 --> 00:25.120
So who gets detention?

00:25.370 --> 00:26.850
The AI, or OpenAI?
